  "title": "王綸之",
  "subject_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-0-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 8,
      "source_quote": "子綸之，字元章。",
      "reading": "延之子，字元章。南齊書原字作倫。",
      "note": "延之子，字元章。南齊書原字作倫。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-8-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 8,
      "end_codepoint": 27,
      "source_quote": "爲安成王記室參軍，偃仰召會，退居僚末。",
      "reading": "入安成王府為記室參軍，敘其退處。",
      "note": "入安成王府為記室參軍，敘其退處。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-27-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 27,
      "end_codepoint": 49,
      "source_quote": "司徒袁粲聞而歎曰：「格外之官，便今日爲重。」",
      "reading": "司徒袁粲歎其使此官見重。",
      "note": "司徒袁粲歎其使此官見重。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-49-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 49,
      "end_codepoint": 71,
      "source_quote": "貴游居此位者，遂以不掌文記爲高，自綸之始也。",
      "reading": "由綸之始，貴游以不掌文記為高。",
      "note": "由綸之始，貴游以不掌文記為高。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-71-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 71,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "source_quote": "齊永明中，歷位侍中，出爲豫章太守。",
      "reading": "齊永明中任侍中，出守豫章。",
      "note": "齊永明中任侍中，出守豫章。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-88-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 88,
      "end_codepoint": 116,
      "source_quote": "下車祭徐孺子、許子將墓，圖畫陳蕃、華歆、謝鯤像於郡朝堂。",
      "reading": "祭徐孺子、許子將二人之墓，畫陳蕃、華歆、謝鯤三人像，兩組各有所指。",
      "note": "祭徐孺子、許子將二人之墓，畫陳蕃、華歆、謝鯤三人像，兩組各有所指。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-116-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 116,
      "end_codepoint": 127,
      "source_quote": "爲政寬簡，稱良二千石。",
      "reading": "豫章任內稱良二千石，為地方評語。",
      "note": "豫章任內稱良二千石，為地方評語。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-127-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 127,
      "end_codepoint": 161,
      "source_quote": "武帝幸琅邪城，綸之與光祿大夫全景文等二十一人坐不參承，爲有司奏免官。",
      "reading": "不參承者共二十一人，此書記有司奏免。齊書有詔免倫之、其餘贖論。",
      "note": "不參承者共二十一人，此書記有司奏免。齊書有詔免倫之、其餘贖論。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-161-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 161,
      "end_codepoint": 173,
      "source_quote": "後位侍中、都官尚書，卒。",
      "reading": "後位侍中、都官尚書，卒年無記。",
      "note": "後位侍中、都官尚書，卒年無記。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "n24-lun-53-173-received_sentence",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACAA",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-024-wang-family:line053",
      "start_codepoint": 173,
      "end_codepoint": 197,
      "source_quote": "自敬弘至綸之，並方嚴，皆克日乃見子孫，蓋家風也。",
      "reading": "自敬弘至綸之，子孫先定日期方見。",
      "note": "自敬弘至綸之，子孫先定日期方見。",
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
